			"notes": "General UX and Priority changes:\n\n- Fabricate is now triggered by holding Left Alt and clicking for crafting one batch, and Shift + Left Alt + Click for a batch of 64.\n\n- Fabricate no longer eats custom click and hover logic from other mods (i.e. creates ponder, EMI's own crafting table display) \n\n- Fabricate will refuse to use enchanted items in recipe chains that would consume said item, opting to craft a new item or use an existing item instead."
		},
